{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_155_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_155","textTraditional":"一、五年，春，公至自晉。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_155_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_155","textTraditional":"二、夏，鄭伯使公子發來聘。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_155_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_155","textTraditional":"三、叔孫豹、繒世子巫如晉。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_155_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_155","textTraditional":"外不言如，而言如，為我事往也。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_155_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_155","textTraditional":"四、仲孫蔑、衞孫林父會吳於善稻。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_155_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_155","textTraditional":"吳謂善伊，謂稻緩。號從中國，名從主人。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_155_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_155","textTraditional":"五、秋，大雩。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_155_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_155","textTraditional":"六、楚殺其大夫公子壬夫。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_155_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_155","textTraditional":"七、公會晉侯、宋公、陳侯、衞侯、鄭伯、曹伯、莒子、邾子、滕子、薛伯、齊世子光、吳人、繒人于戚。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_clt_155_10","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_155","textTraditional":"八、公至自會。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_clt_155_11","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_155","textTraditional":"九、冬，戍陳。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_clt_155_12","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_155","textTraditional":"內辭也。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_clt_155_13","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_155","textTraditional":"十、楚公子貞帥師伐陳。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_clt_155_14","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_155","textTraditional":"十一、公會晉侯、宋公、衞侯、鄭伯、曹伯、莒子、邾子、滕子、薛伯、齊世子光救陳。","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_clt_155_15","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_155","textTraditional":"十二、十有二月，公至自救陳。","sentenceOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_clt_155_16","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_155","textTraditional":"善救陳也。","sentenceOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_clt_155_17","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_155","textTraditional":"十三、辛未，季孫行父卒。","sentenceOrder":17}],"overrides":{}}